# Examples

This folder contains C programming exercises and examples completed during my university studies.

## Purpose

The examples in this folder were created for learning, practice, and exam preparation. They cover different topics in C programming and data structures.

## Topics Covered

* Basic C Programming
* Functions
* Arrays and Strings
* Pointers
* Dynamic Memory Allocation
* Structures
* Linked Lists
* Recursion
* Data Structures
* Algorithm Exercises

## Notes

* These files are educational exercises and may not always contain the best or most efficient solutions.
* Some source codes may be incomplete or contain mistakes, as they were written while learning the concepts.
* The repository serves as a record of my progress and coursework.

## Disclaimer

The code in this folder is provided for educational purposes only. Correctness is not guaranteed, and some solutions may require improvements or corrections.

